* `copyAx dA`: `gflat L ++ l` on `0` and `l₂` on `rZ` ↦ `gflat L ++ l₂` on `rZ`, stack `0`
  unchanged (`copyAx_runs`);
* `swapAx dA`: `gflat A ++ l` on `0`, `gflat B ++ l₂` on `rZ` ↦ `gflat B ++ l` on `0`,
  `gflat A ++ l₂` on `rZ` (`swapAx_runs`).

Convention (`FineBody6`): every stack other than `0, dA, rZ` empty; `dA ∉ {0, …, 7, 53}`,
`dA < 56`.
